-- ==========================================
-- CHANGES FROM v29:
--
--  NEW STRATEGY: Run-toward-laser + jump over it
--    Instead of hunting for a "safe spot" and jumping
--    away from lasers, the bot now:
--      1. Identifies the primary threat laser
--      2. Computes the point on the laser's centre-line
--         that is directly "in front" of the bot
--      3. Runs toward that crossing point
--      4. Jumps OVER the laser (direction = through it)
--         so it lands safely on the far side
--    This works much better with multiple lasers because
--    the space just behind a laser you just jumped over
--    is always clear.
--
--  LIVE ARC VISUALIZER
--    The planned jump arc (green dashed line in the image)
--    is now redrawn every Heartbeat frame so it continuously
--    tracks the rotating laser in real time, exactly like
--    the reference image shows.
--
--  APPROACH logic
--    When primary TTI <= APPROACH_TTI (2.5s) the bot runs
--    toward the laser crossing point instead of the generic
--    safe spot. The crossing point is clamped to be just
--    in front of the laser (not on top of it).
--
--  All v29 reliability fixes (FIX 1-6) kept intact.
-- ==========================================
